            datasheet: "CLA4 - 4-bit carry lookahead unit\n\nFrom the generate (G) and propagate (P) signals of four bits or groups and the carry in CI:\n\n- C1 = G0 + P0.CI\n- C2 = G1 + P1.G0 + P1.P0.CI\n- C3 = G2 + P2.G1 + P2.P1.G0 + P2.P1.P0.CI\n- G = G3 + P3.G2 + P3.P2.G1 + P3.P2.P1.G0 (group generate)\n- P = P3.P2.P1.P0 (group propagate)\n\nTwo gate delays from any input to any output. Used for bits within a nibble, nibbles within 16 bits and the four 32-bit slices.",
