            datasheet: "ALU bit - one bit of the W-128 ALU\n\nOperand B = RB.SREG + IMM.SIMM + DIN.SMEM (register, immediate or memory), inverted when SUB = 1.\n\n- G = A.B, P = A xor B (carry generate / propagate)\n- sum S = P xor CI\n- Y = S.OSUM + G.OAND + (A + B).OOR + P.OXOR + SL.OSHL + SR.OSHR + B.OPB\n\nSL is the next lower bit of A (shift left), SR the next higher (shift right). Exactly one O* line is 1.",
