            ],
            datasheet: "ALU32 - 32-bit ALU of one CPU slice\n\nTwo ALU16 halves. C16 = G(lo) + P(lo).CI; the slice generate G = G(hi) + P(hi).G(lo) and propagate P = P(hi).P(lo) go to the board\'s CLA4, which returns the slice\'s carry in. Z = 1 when all 32 result bits are 0. IMMX feeds bits 16-31 of the immediate (the sign extension).",
