            datasheet: "RegFile32 - one 32-bit lane of the register file\n\nRegisters r1-r7 (Reg32), a write decoder (RD, WE) and two read decoders (RA, RB) driving four RdMux8. Register r0 has no storage: reading it gives 0, writing it does nothing. The hex displays show every register\'s 32 bits live (enter a running slice to see them).",
